order-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Flag Challenger for human review; freeze rollout</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:0pt"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Pipeline Reliability</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Post-Generation Run</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Worker task execution success log</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Render failure rate &gt; 20\%</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Terminate experiment; revert worker configuration</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:14pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Canary Deployment Protocols</span></h3><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Challenger policies are restricted to an initial canary batch of N=2 uploads. The Decision Compiler ingests metrics at 48 hours and 7 days post-upload. If any circuit breaker trips, the system executes an automated rollback: the active policy pointer reverts immediately to the prior Champion version, the Challenger is marked REJECTED_REGRESSION, and further experimentation within that content pillar is paused until human review.</span></p><h3 style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:14pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Rolling Holdout Calibration</span></h3><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:11.2pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">To distinguish between policy regressions and macro-platform downturns (e.g., category-wide seasonal drops in viewer activity), the engine maintains a rolling 10\% historical holdout cohort produced under frozen baseline parameters. If both the canary batch and the holdout cohort decline in parallel, the drop is attributed to macro seasonality rather than policy degradation, preventing false rollback triggers.</span></p><h2 style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;font-size:18pt;padding-bottom:11.2pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:18pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">13. Policy Versioning Infrastructure</span></h2><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Every video published by the autonomous engine must maintain immutable traceability back to the exact operational policy active during its generation. Production policies are serialized as JSON schema artifacts and versioned according to semantic versioning:</span></p><ul class="lst-kix_list_10-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0;margin-right:0;margin-left:30pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">MAJOR</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">: Structural architectural overhauls (e.g., transition to a new generative video model, narrative framework rewrites).</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0;margin-right:0;margin-left:30pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">MINOR</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">: Validated experimental promotions (e.g., new hook pacing targets, verified transition density standards).</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0;margin-right:0;margin-left:30pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">PATCH</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">: Minor operational calibrations (e.g., worker timeout adjustments, minor audio ducking corrections).</span></li></ul><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Courier&quot;;font-style:normal">{<br> &nbsp;"policy_id": "pol_science_longform_0088",<br> &nbsp;"version": "2.4.0",<br> &nbsp;"created_at": "2026-03-30T12:00:00Z",<br> &nbsp;"parent_version": "2.3.1",<br> &nbsp;"status": "ACTIVE_CHAMPION",<br> &nbsp;"scope": {<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;"channel_id": "UC_autonomous_science",<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;"content_pillar": "deep_dive_explainer",<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;"target_duration_sec": [480, 720]<br> &nbsp;},<br> &nbsp;"evidence_ids": ["evi_retention_hook_088"],<br> &nbsp;"experiment_ids": ["exp_pacing_2026_04"],<br> &nbsp;"parameters": {<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;"script": {<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;"hook_structure": "cold_open_curiosity_gap",<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;"pacing_target_wpm": 165,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;"max_scene_duration_sec": 4.0<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;},<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;"visual": {<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;"motion_profile": "hybrid_deterministic_diffusion",<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;"transition_density_sec": 3.0,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;"color_grading_lut": "high_contrast_clean"<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;},<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;"audio": {<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;"voice_id": "eleven_labs_expressive_02",<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;"ducking_level_db": -18.0<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;}<br> &nbsp;},<br> &nbsp;"rollback_policy": {<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;"auto_revert_version": "2.3.1",<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;"monitoring_window_days": 14,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;"max_tolerated_apv_drop_percent": -5.0<br> &nbsp;}<br>}<br></span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:11.2pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Every published video artifact record embeds this metadata: video_id: "yt_0912" -&gt; policy_id: "pol_science_longform_0088" -&gt; version: "2.4.0" -&gt; experiment_id: "exp_pacing_2026_04" -&gt; variant: "CHALLENGER_B". This lineage guarantees that subsequent analytics ingestion can attribute viewer responses directly to specific parameter configurations.</span></p><h2 style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;font-size:18pt;padding-bottom:11.2pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:18pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">14. Append-Only Decision Ledger</span></h2><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">All operational updates executed by the compiler are logged to a tamper-evident, append-only SQLite database table. The ledger records the rationale, evidence IDs, and authorizing mode for every production choice:</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Courier&quot;;font-style:normal">CREATE TABLE decision_ledger (<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;decision_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;timestamp DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;decision_type TEXT CHECK(decision_type IN (<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;'KEEP_STRATEGY', 'RUN_EXPERIMENT', 'ADOPT_CHANGE', <br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;'ROLL_BACK_CHANGE', 'IGNORE_EVIDENCE', 'COLLECT_MORE_DATA', <br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;'ESCALATE_TO_HUMAN'<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;)) NOT NULL,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;scope_channel_id TEXT NOT NULL,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;scope_content_pillar TEXT NOT NULL,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;policy_version_before TEXT NOT NULL,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;policy_version_after TEXT NOT NULL,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;triggering_candidate_id TEXT,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;experiment_id TEXT,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;evidence_ids_json TEXT NOT NULL,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;decision_rationale TEXT NOT NULL,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;expected_outcome_metrics_json TEXT NOT NULL,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;actual_outcome_metrics_json TEXT,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;rollback_status TEXT DEFAULT 'ACTIVE' CHECK(rollback_status IN ('ACTIVE', 'ROLLED_BACK', 'SUPERSEDED')),<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;authorizing_mode TEXT CHECK(authorizing_mode IN (<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;'AUTO', 'AUTO_WITH_BOUNDS', 'PROPOSE_AND_CONFIRM', 'HUMAN_REQUIRED'<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;)) NOT NULL,<br> &nbsp; &nbsp;ledger_entry_hash TEXT NOT NULL<br>);<br></span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:11.2pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">The ledger_entry_hash is computed as the SHA-256 hash of the row values concatenated with the previous row's hash, establishing an immutable cryptographic chain. This structure ensures that any unauthorized modification or manual tampering is immediately detected during audit cycles.</span></p><h2 style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;font-size:18pt;padding-bottom:11.2pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:18pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">15. Hermes Decision Interface Boundary</span></h2><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">To prevent agent hallucination and statistical distortion, Hermes is structurally decoupled from data analysis and policy compilation:</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Courier&quot;;font-style:normal">Runtime Decoupling Pipeline:<br>[Analytics &amp; Measurement Store] â”€â”€â–º [Decision Compiler &amp; Statistical Engine]<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; â”‚<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; â–¼<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[ProductionPolicy vX.Y.Z]<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; â”‚<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; â–¼<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[Hermes Execution Runtime]<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; â”‚<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; â–¼<br> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [Video Production Execution]<br></span></p><ul class="lst-kix_list_11-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0;margin-right:0;margin-left:30pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">Interface Isolation Invariant</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">: Hermes never imports statistical libraries (scipy, statsmodels, spotify-confidence, msprt). Hermes never receives raw view counts, p-values, e-values, or loss curves.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0;margin-right:0;margin-left:30pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">Input Context</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">: Hermes consumes only a fully resolved, immutable ProductionPolicy JSON document. During planning, Hermes reads explicit configuration values: policy.parameters.script.pacing_target_wpm or policy.parameters.visual.transition_density_sec.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0;margin-right:0;margin-left:30pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">Output Context</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">: Hermes outputs deterministic generation manifests and task dispatches. Each output artifact is stamped with the active policy_id, version, and experiment_id.</span></li></ul><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:11.2pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span>Hermes plans </span><span style="font-style:italic">within</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;policy parameters; it does not plan the policies themselves.</span></p><h2 style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;font-weight:700;padding-left:0;font-size:18pt;padding-bottom:11.2pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:18pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">16. Tiered Human Oversight Model</span></h2><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Autonomous operations are governed through a four-tier oversight model calibrated by operational reversibility and capital risk:</span></p><table style="border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;margin-right:auto"><thead><tr style="height:0pt"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Approval Tier</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Operational Scope</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Blast Radius</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Autonomous Authority</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Required Action</span></p></td></tr></thead><tbody></tbody><tbody><tr style="height:0pt"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">AUTO</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Small worker retry limits, local temp cache clearance, minor render fallback profiles</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Zero audience impact; internal execution only</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Full autonomy</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Immediate execution and logging</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:0pt"><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid"><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">AUTO_WITH_BOUNDS</span></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-top-width:1pt;border-right-width:1pt;border-left-color:#000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:#000000;border-left-width:1pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width:93.6pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-botto